ck affected 192.7 million people"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In healthcare, the companies that move money between payers and providers are critical infrastructure.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.pymnts.com/cybersecurity/2025/us-health-dept-says-unitedhealth-hack-impacted-192-7-million-consumers-data/", "label": "PYMNTS, UnitedHealth hack affected 192.7 million people"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "The 2024 Change Healthcare attack exposed data on about 192.7 million people and froze claims nationwide, after hackers used a portal without MFA.", "sectionKey": "frontier"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$43101571-2c90-58e1-8a57-37bf8558185c$ml$::uuid, $ml$healthtech$ml$, $ml$Paying for outcomes, not visits$ml$, 'LESSON', ARRAY[$ml$MICRO_LESSON$ml$, $ml$day-7$ml$, $ml$month-1$ml$, $ml$handwritten-v1$ml$, $ml$goal:career$ml$, $ml$level:beginner$ml$, $ml$level:intermediate$ml$, $ml$level:advanced$ml$]::text[], 5, now(), '{}'::jsonb, $ml${"id": "healthtech-d7-career", "title": "Paying for outcomes, not visits", "exercises": [{"id": "open", "kind": "coldOpen", "kicker": "Some providers now share in what they save.", "eyebrow": "Day 7 · Healthcare financing", "headline": "Medicare's accountable care organizations saved the program a record $2.4 billion in 2024.", "fullText": "The 476 ACOs in the Medicare Shared Savings Program covered 10.3 million beneficiaries. About 75% of them earned shared savings, receiving $4.1 billion in performance payments, the highest share since the program began. Nearly all beat similar physician groups on quality measures.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "vbc", "eyebrow": "The model", "text": "Value-based care pays providers partly for keeping costs down and quality up.", "highlight": "It counters the volume incentive of fee-for-service.", "keyTerms": [{"term": "Value-based care", "definition": "Payment models that reward providers for quality and cost results, not just services delivered."}], "sources": [{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "aco", "eyebrow": "The vehicle", "text": "An ACO is a group of providers that takes joint responsibility for patients' cost and quality.", "highlight": "If they save Medicare money, they share in it.", "keyTerms": [{"term": "ACO", "definition": "Accountable care organization: providers that share responsibility and savings for a patient group."}], "sources": [{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "quality", "eyebrow": "The quality side", "title": "Better on key measures", "body": "ACOs improved blood pressure control, A1c levels and depression follow-up plans.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]}, {"kind": "sortSignal", "id": "sort", "prompt": "Does it reward volume or value?", "buckets": ["Volume", "Value"], "items": [{"text": "Paying per visit or test", "bucket": 0}, {"text": "More procedures, more revenue", "bucket": 0}, {"text": "Sharing savings below a benchmark", "bucket": 1}, {"text": "Bonuses for quality measures", "bucket": 1}], "explanation": "Fee-for-service rewards volume; ACOs share savings and quality bonuses."}, {"kind": "multipleChoice", "id": "mc", "prompt": "How much did Medicare ACOs save the program in 2024?", "options": ["About $240 million", "About $2.4 billion", "About $24 billion"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "A record $2.4 billion in net savings."}, {"id": "lens-career", "kind": "info", "title": "Value-based roles", "body": "ACOs hire care coordinators, data analysts and quality leads. These roles grow with value-based care.", "eyebrow": "For your interview", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In healthcare payment, whatever you pay for, you get more of.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Medicare's 476 ACOs saved a record $2.4 billion in 2024, and 75% earned shared savings totaling $4.1 billion.", "sectionKey": "players"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
