om/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "MedPAC estimated Medicare Advantage would cost about $84 billion, or 20%, more than traditional Medicare in 2025, from selection and coding.", "sectionKey": "gap"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
