.", "keyTerms": [{"term": "Risk adjustment", "definition": "Raising or lowering payments based on how sick a plan's members appear."}], "sources": [{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "selection", "eyebrow": "Favorable selection", "title": "Healthier members join", "body": "Members with similar risk scores cost less in MA than in traditional Medicare. That gap adds about $44 billion.", "sources": [{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]}, {"kind": "numberSense", "id": "ns-extra", "prompt": "About how many billion dollars more did MedPAC estimate MA would cost in 2025?", "min": 0, "max": 200, "value": 84, "unit": "B", "tolerance": 0.06, "explanation": "About $84 billion, or 20% more than traditional Medicare."}, {"kind": "faceOff", "id": "face", "prompt": "Which driver did MedPAC estimate added more to MA's extra cost?", "left": {"name": "Favorable selection", "note": "About $44 billion"}, "right": {"name": "Coding intensity", "note": "About $40 billion"}, "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Favorable selection added about $44 billion and coding intensity about $40 billion."}, {"id": "lens-curiosity", "kind": "info", "title": "Private plans cost more", "body": "Medicare's private plans were projected to cost about $84 billion more than traditional Medicare in 2025.", "eyebrow": "Why it matters", "sources": [{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In Medicare Advantage, how sick members look on paper drives how much plans get paid.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://healthcare-b