"}], "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366594714/OCR-Settles-11-HIPAA-Right-of-Access-Cases", "label": "TechTarget, OCR settles 11 HIPAA right of access cases"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "range", "eyebrow": "The cost", "title": "From $3,500 to $240,000", "body": "Settlements in a 2022 batch ranged from $3,500 for a small practice to $240,000 for a health system.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366594714/OCR-Settles-11-HIPAA-Right-of-Access-Cases", "label": "TechTarget, OCR settles 11 HIPAA right of access cases"}]}, {"kind": "multipleChoice", "id": "mc", "prompt": "Who enforces HIPAA's right of access?", "options": ["The Food and Drug Administration", "The HHS Office for Civil Rights", "Each state medical board"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "HHS's Office for Civil Rights runs the Right of Access Initiative."}, {"kind": "sortSignal", "id": "sort", "prompt": "Does this support or block a patient's right of access?", "buckets": ["Supports", "Blocks"], "items": [{"text": "Sending records when asked", "bucket": 0}, {"text": "Offering a patient portal", "bucket": 0}, {"text": "Ignoring a records request", "bucket": 1}, {"text": "Delaying for months", "bucket": 1}], "explanation": "Ignoring or delaying requests led to OCR enforcement."}, {"id": "lens-curiosity", "kind": "info", "title": "Your records, your right", "body": "US patients have a legal right to get copies of their own medical records.", "eyebrow": "Why it matters", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366594714/OCR-Settles-11-HIPAA-Right-of-Access-Cases", "label": "TechTarget, OCR settles 11 HIPAA right of access cases"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In health data, privacy rules also guarantee patients access to their own information.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366594714/OCR-Settles-11-HIPAA-Right-of-Access-Cases", "label": "TechTarget, OCR settles 11 HIPAA right of access cases"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "HIPAA gives patients a right to their records. By 2022, OCR had brought 38 enforcement actions over ignored requests.", "sectionKey": "basics"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$4fc3f9ff-17e7-5531-8cc4-30fc5f2a063f$ml$::uuid, $ml$healthtech$ml$, $ml$The costliest breaches$ml$, 'LESSON', ARRAY[$ml$MICRO_LESSON$ml$, $ml$day-14$ml$, $ml$month-1$ml$, $ml$handwritten-v1$ml$, $ml$goal:career$ml$, $ml$level:beginner$ml$, $ml$level:intermediate$ml$, $ml$level:advanced$ml$]::text[], 5, now(), '{}'::jsonb, $ml${"id": "healthtech-d14-career", "title": "The costliest breaches", "exercises": [{"id": "open", "kind": "coldOpen", "kicker": "Healthcare pays more for breaches than any other industry.", "eyebrow": "Day 14 · The money", "headline": "A healthcare data breach cost an average of $7.42 million in 2025, according to IBM's annual report.", "fullText": "That was down from $9.77 million in 2024, but healthcare was still the costliest industry for the 14th year in a row. The global average across industries was $4.44 million. Healthcare breaches took about 279 days to identify and contain.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366628031/Healthcare-remains-costliest-industry-for-breaches-at-742M", "label": "TechTarget, healthcare remains costliest industry for breaches"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "why", "eyebrow": "Why so costly", "text": "Health data is sensitive and breaches take long to find and fix.", "highlight": "About 279 days on average.", "keyTerms": [{"term": "Data breach", "definition": "An incident in which protected information is accessed or disclosed without authorization."}], "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366628031/Healthcare-remains-costliest-industry-for-breaches-at-742M", "label": "TechTarget, healthcare remains costliest industry for breaches"}]}, {"kind": "microInsight", "id": "gap", "eyebrow": "The gap", "text": "Healthcare breaches cost far more than the $4.44 million global average.", "highlight": "It has been the costliest industry for 14 years.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366628031/Healthcare-remains-costliest-industry-for-breaches-at-742M", "label": "TechTarget, healthcare remains costliest industry for breaches"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "trend", "eyebrow": "The trend", "title": "Down, but still highest", "body": "Average healthcare breach costs fell from $9.77 million to $7.42 million in a year.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366628031/Healthcare-remains-costliest-industry-for-breaches-at-742M", "label": "TechTarget, healthcare remains costliest industry for breaches"}]}, {"kind": "numberSense", "id": "ns-days", "prompt": "About how many days did healthcare breaches take to identify and contain in 2025?", "min": 0, "max": 600, "value": 279, "unit": "days", "tolerance": 0.06, "explanation": "About 279 days, about five weeks longer than the global average."}, {"kind": "faceOff", "id": "face", "prompt": "Which had the higher average breach cost in 2025?", "left": {"name": "Healthcare", "note": "$7.42 million"}, "right": {"name": "All industries", "note": "$4.44 million"}, "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Healthcare was the costliest industry for the 14th year in a row."}, {"id": "lens-career", "kind": "info", "title": "Security pays in health", "body": "With the highest breach costs, healthcare invests heavily in security talent.", "eyebrow": "For your interview", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366628031/Healthcare-remains-costliest-industry-for-breaches-at-742M", "label": "TechTarget, healthcare remains costliest industry for breaches"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In healthcare, the longer a breach goes unnoticed, the more it costs.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.techtarget.com/healthtechsecurity/news/366628031/Healthcare-remains-costliest-industry-for-breaches-at-742M", "label": "TechTarget, healthcare remains costliest industry for breaches"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Healthcare breaches cost an average of $7.42 million in 2025, the costliest industry for 14 straight years.", "sectionKey": "how_money_moves"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
