ly", "label": "Holland & Knight, HIPAA's reproductive health rule vacated nationally"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In US health privacy, courts can undo a rule nationwide in a single decision.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.hklaw.com/en/insights/publications/2025/06/hipaas-reproductive-health-rule-is-vacated-nationally", "label": "Holland & Knight, HIPAA's reproductive health rule vacated nationally"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "A Texas federal court vacated the 2024 HIPAA reproductive health privacy rule nationwide on June 18, 2025.", "sectionKey": "risk"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
