($ml$086fe89f-ab39-5ed9-aad9-3f1946ec9403$ml$::uuid, $ml$4bea078d-8f08-543e-a476-61f028329126$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Paid to save money$ml$, $ml$Some doctors earn bonuses when they save Medicare money while keeping care quality high.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b1ab84b9-e406-52ae-b546-097a515c91d3$ml$::uuid, $ml$4bea078d-8f08-543e-a476-61f028329126$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In healthcare payment, whatever you pay for, you get more of.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/mssp-acos-saved-24b-2024-setting-new-record-program", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, Medicare ACOs saved $2.4B in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$0eb645a0-b216-5fd8-a6b5-e38d1243b7c2$ml$::uuid, $ml$2227822d-b31f-5e25-a285-36ceaf6cdc9d$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 8 · The money$ml$, $ml$Medicare was projected to pay private Medicare Advantage plans $538 billion in 2025, about 20%, or $84 billion, more than it would spend on the same people in traditional Medicare. That is the estimate from MedPAC, Congress's Medicare advisers. About $44 billion comes from favorable selection: plan members tend to be cheaper than their risk scores suggest. About $40 billion comes from coding intensity: plans record more diagnoses, raising payments.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$4ba0b5d7-6ccd-51eb-b5fa-eb686336d60f$ml$::uuid, $ml$2227822d-b31f-5e25-a285-36ceaf6cdc9d$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The program$ml$, $ml$Medicare Advantage lets private insurers run Medicare benefits for a set payment per member. Payments are adjusted by each member's risk score.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$5018f5d4-35ae-5329-a917-33326770c9ae$ml$::uuid, $ml$2227822d-b31f-5e25-a285-36ceaf6cdc9d$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$Coding intensity$ml$, $ml$Recording more diagnoses raises risk scores and payments. MA risk scores ran about 16% higher before adjustments.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$8a056138-0424-588e-8b28-c0012a99b3c7$ml$::uuid, $ml$2227822d-b31f-5e25-a285-36ceaf6cdc9d$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Healthier members join$ml$, $ml$Members with similar risk scores cost less in MA than in traditional Medicare. That gap adds about $44 billion.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$a892154e-d677-5e92-a646-4ab16b0921c5$ml$::uuid, $ml$2227822d-b31f-5e25-a285-36ceaf6cdc9d$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Risk adjustment is big business$ml$, $ml$Insurers hire coders and analysts to manage risk scores. Regulators hire people to check them.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b0e1cfcc-c236-5dc2-8bef-9793e6a77506$ml$::uuid, $ml$2227822d-b31f-5e25-a285-36ceaf6cdc9d$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In Medicare Advantage, how sick members look on paper drives how much plans get paid.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
