($ml$66251468-429e-5eb1-a95e-63d5204bef0b$ml$::uuid, $ml$8c1b665e-f3a8-5d1c-b7be-ad2d0ea6eda7$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The program$ml$, $ml$Medicare Advantage lets private insurers run Medicare benefits for a set payment per member. Payments are adjusted by each member's risk score.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$9e019cea-3cef-59c6-a5df-a294fdb8b1a0$ml$::uuid, $ml$8c1b665e-f3a8-5d1c-b7be-ad2d0ea6eda7$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$Coding intensity$ml$, $ml$Recording more diagnoses raises risk scores and payments. MA risk scores ran about 16% higher before adjustments.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$120e14a4-1936-5b8c-b780-405661e0612f$ml$::uuid, $ml$8c1b665e-f3a8-5d1c-b7be-ad2d0ea6eda7$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Healthier members join$ml$, $ml$Members with similar risk scores cost less in MA than in traditional Medicare. That gap adds about $44 billion.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$1f2805ab-04a5-55eb-8b01-e76183f6d529$ml$::uuid, $ml$8c1b665e-f3a8-5d1c-b7be-ad2d0ea6eda7$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Accurate coding tools$ml$, $ml$Plans and regulators both need accurate diagnosis data. Tools that audit coding have buyers.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$58ebffc1-bf75-5da7-92ab-ba5e176d3729$ml$::uuid, $ml$8c1b665e-f3a8-5d1c-b7be-ad2d0ea6eda7$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In Medicare Advantage, how sick members look on paper drives how much plans get paid.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$0021d912-7fe9-5b83-8088-2d548b5c54af$ml$::uuid, $ml$f588d06c-d055-51a4-8554-2996fe3ab0c5$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 8 · The money$ml$, $ml$Medicare was projected to pay private Medicare Advantage plans $538 billion in 2025, about 20%, or $84 billion, more than it would spend on the same people in traditional Medicare. That is the estimate from MedPAC, Congress's Medicare advisers. About $44 billion comes from favorable selection: plan members tend to be cheaper than their risk scores suggest. About $40 billion comes from coding intensity: plans record more diagnoses, raising payments.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$dfab37e8-41b3-57ab-af71-ff60ad24b095$ml$::uuid, $ml$f588d06c-d055-51a4-8554-2996fe3ab0c5$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The program$ml$, $ml$Medicare Advantage lets private insurers run Medicare benefits for a set payment per member. Payments are adjusted by each member's risk score.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$8deb9a80-7263-5c50-acf1-5cadf9d4ec4a$ml$::uuid, $ml$f588d06c-d055-51a4-8554-2996fe3ab0c5$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$Coding intensity$ml$, $ml$Recording more diagnoses raises risk scores and payments. MA risk scores ran about 16% higher before adjustments.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$efa50233-282b-58a9-9e15-1ea15aedf56f$ml$::uuid, $ml$f588d06c-d055-51a4-8554-2996fe3ab0c5$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Healthier members join$ml$, $ml$Members with similar risk scores cost less in MA than in traditional Medicare. That gap adds about $44 billion.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$195d5555-d300-5726-bea8-aa82904f5a8e$ml$::uuid, $ml$f588d06c-d055-51a4-8554-2996fe3ab0c5$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Private plans cost more$ml$, $ml$Medicare's private plans were projected to cost about $84 billion more than traditional Medicare in 2025.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3723cbd2-9cc2-5761-be37-0579fdd5b036$ml$::uuid, $ml$f588d06c-d055-51a4-8554-2996fe3ab0c5$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In Medicare Advantage, how sick members look on paper drives how much plans get paid.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://healthcare-brew.com/stories/2025/03/18/medicare-advantage-cost-government-84-billion-2025", "label": "Healthcare Brew, MedPAC on Medicare Advantage costs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$e2282464-afe2-5741-9ff5-c537f9989b88$ml$::uuid, $ml$049a7284-0d38-53ee-b7b2-b914803ab82f$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 9 · The power$ml$, $ml$By late 2023, UnitedHealth Group's Optum had nearly 90,000 employed or affiliated physicians, making it the largest employer of physicians in the US. Optum added nearly 20,000 physicians in 2023 alone, up from 70,000 at the end of 2022. UnitedHealth also owns UnitedHealthcare, one of the largest US insurers. Owning both the payer and the providers is called vertical integration.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.beckershospitalreview.com/legal-regulatory-issues/optum-added-nearly-20-000-physicians-in-2023", "label": "Becker's, Optum now has 90,000 physicians"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$5b73aac2-fdf7-5050-a275-bcb33b2ecdc7$ml$::uuid, $ml$049a7284-0d38-53ee-b7b2-b914803ab82f$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The structure$ml$, $ml$Vertical integration means owning several steps of the chain, from insurance to care. Money can stay inside one company.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.beckershospitalreview.com/legal-regulatory-issues/optum-added-nearly-20-000-physicians-in-2023", "label": "Becker's, Optum now has 90,000 physicians"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$d2d2b7fa-d513-56d2-8a0b-bfa10c7e3bdb$ml$::uuid, $ml$049a7284-0d38-53ee-b7b2-b914803ab82f$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The pace$ml$, $ml$Optum added nearly 20,000 doctors in a single year. From 70,000 to nearly 90,000.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.beckershospitalreview.com/legal-regulatory-issues/optum-added-nearly-20-000-physicians-in-2023", "label": "Becker's, Optum now has 90,000 physicians"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$0cce8bcb-1e42-55b7-a616-03aa25403618$ml$::uuid, $ml$049a7284-0d38-53ee-b7b2-b914803ab82f$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Money stays in-house$ml$, $ml$When an insurer owns practices, what it pays those doctors stays inside the same company.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.beckershospitalreview.com/legal-regulatory-issues/optum-added-nearly-20-000-physicians-in-2023", "label": "Becker's, Optum now has 90,000 physicians"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$5f1eb895-fd23-5073-8e9b-69fdeefa233e$ml$::uuid, $ml$049a7284-0d38-53ee-b7b2-b914803ab82f$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Doctors as employees$ml$, $ml$More physicians now work for large corporations. That shapes careers and contracts in medicine.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.beckershospitalreview.com/legal-regulatory-issues/optum-added-nearly-20-000-physicians-in-2023", "label": "Becker's, Optum now has 90,000 physicians"}]$ml$::jsonb),
