($ml$553c88b8-0d00-5d95-867f-1293c38eb638$ml$::uuid, $ml$c1de9d88-b9d3-5175-b2fe-f46fca93bb94$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The drugs$ml$, $ml$The list includes blood thinners, diabetes drugs and insulins. Eliquis, Xarelto, Jardiance, Januvia and more.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/cms-negotiated-drug-prices-would-have-saved-medicare-6b-last-year", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, negotiated drug prices would have saved Medicare $6B"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$50646fbe-fa5f-5f6f-8dd3-01af9b90de0d$ml$::uuid, $ml$c1de9d88-b9d3-5175-b2fe-f46fca93bb94$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$About $1.5 billion saved$ml$, $ml$CMS expected patients to save about $1.5 billion out of pocket in 2026, varying by plan.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/cms-negotiated-drug-prices-would-have-saved-medicare-6b-last-year", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, negotiated drug prices would have saved Medicare $6B"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$783aed64-6d8c-5cc4-afc2-3b24dc9253a1$ml$::uuid, $ml$c1de9d88-b9d3-5175-b2fe-f46fca93bb94$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Medicare sets a price$ml$, $ml$In 2026, Medicare paid negotiated prices for 10 common drugs for the first time.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/cms-negotiated-drug-prices-would-have-saved-medicare-6b-last-year", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, negotiated drug prices would have saved Medicare $6B"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$0c6d1d70-7ee3-5707-855c-de093c22e94d$ml$::uuid, $ml$c1de9d88-b9d3-5175-b2fe-f46fca93bb94$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In drug pricing, whoever buys the most can eventually set the price.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/regulatory/cms-negotiated-drug-prices-would-have-saved-medicare-6b-last-year", "label": "Fierce Healthcare, negotiated drug prices would have saved Medicare $6B"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$c65cf54c-b49d-5dbf-bea8-cda80bd44ea1$ml$::uuid, $ml$5e5d8354-4004-511f-ad64-567ede392cd7$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 12 · Where it breaks$ml$, $ml$On January 1, 2026, CMS began a six-year test using AI to run prior authorization for some services in traditional Medicare, in six states. The WISeR model covers Arizona, New Jersey, Ohio, Oklahoma, Texas and Washington. It targets services such as skin substitutes, nerve stimulators and knee arthroscopy for osteoarthritis. Technology vendors are paid if they reduce Medicare spending, which hospital groups warned could encourage denials.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.dinsmore.com/publications/is-ai-wiser-cms-models-ai-based-prior-authorization-process-in-six-states/", "label": "Dinsmore, CMS models AI-based prior authorization in six states"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$89eb5d21-cadc-5fff-b65c-34c6991212b1$ml$::uuid, $ml$5e5d8354-4004-511f-ad64-567ede392cd7$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The process$ml$, $ml$Prior authorization means getting approval before treatment so it will be paid for. Traditional Medicare rarely used it until now.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.dinsmore.com/publications/is-ai-wiser-cms-models-ai-based-prior-authorization-process-in-six-states/", "label": "Dinsmore, CMS models AI-based prior authorization in six states"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3dc73d9d-e95c-5d8a-bdc3-8f680a3a67d7$ml$::uuid, $ml$5e5d8354-4004-511f-ad64-567ede392cd7$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The safeguard$ml$, $ml$A human clinician reviews any denial before it is final. AI makes the first pass.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.dinsmore.com/publications/is-ai-wiser-cms-models-ai-based-prior-authorization-process-in-six-states/", "label": "Dinsmore, CMS models AI-based prior authorization in six states"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$4c8d63a2-27ca-52de-9414-2884e912100f$ml$::uuid, $ml$5e5d8354-4004-511f-ad64-567ede392cd7$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Paid for savings$ml$, $ml$Vendors earn more when spending falls. The American Hospital Association said that could push denials.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.dinsmore.com/publications/is-ai-wiser-cms-models-ai-based-prior-authorization-process-in-six-states/", "label": "Dinsmore, CMS models AI-based prior authorization in six states"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$6b7fb114-f8c2-5682-af96-f1216542fbb4$ml$::uuid, $ml$5e5d8354-4004-511f-ad64-567ede392cd7$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$AI meets utilization review$ml$, $ml$Payers need clinicians and data scientists who can oversee AI decisions.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.dinsmore.com/publications/is-ai-wiser-cms-models-ai-based-prior-authorization-process-in-six-states/", "label": "Dinsmore, CMS models AI-based prior authorization in six states"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$af80ecf2-6e8c-58c0-afcb-7dbc21a0f0e1$ml$::uuid, $ml$5e5d8354-4004-511f-ad64-567ede392cd7$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In healthcare AI, how vendors are paid shapes the decisions their systems make.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.dinsmore.com/publications/is-ai-wiser-cms-models-ai-based-prior-authorization-process-in-six-states/", "label": "Dinsmore, CMS models AI-based prior authorization in six states"}]$ml$::jsonb),
