($ml$3a8b207b-e3ab-59a3-9bdb-323ac76d7fce$ml$::uuid, $ml$e76fa1a0-9ab0-5099-9402-dd4035e96f7b$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Too costly for small hospitals$ml$, $ml$Hospitals said they lacked staff for required testing, and multi-factor logins could slow care in some settings.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.axios.com/2025/01/13/hospitals-cyber-security-rule-upgrade", "label": "Axios, hospitals balk at cybersecurity rule upgrade"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$669c5f4d-3469-58e8-b964-e9820a975d11$ml$::uuid, $ml$e76fa1a0-9ab0-5099-9402-dd4035e96f7b$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$$9 billion for safety$ml$, $ml$Tougher HIPAA security rules were estimated to cost $9 billion in their first year.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.axios.com/2025/01/13/hospitals-cyber-security-rule-upgrade", "label": "Axios, hospitals balk at cybersecurity rule upgrade"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$c1292f5d-c624-59a4-9777-1507fb4a1ab0$ml$::uuid, $ml$e76fa1a0-9ab0-5099-9402-dd4035e96f7b$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In health data security, every new safeguard has a cost someone must carry.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.axios.com/2025/01/13/hospitals-cyber-security-rule-upgrade", "label": "Axios, hospitals balk at cybersecurity rule upgrade"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$eaede0a5-29c5-5e86-9133-371a3322fe8c$ml$::uuid, $ml$fd09bfa3-75e1-5b72-8781-374eb0464b74$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 17 · The rule$ml$, $ml$On June 18, 2025, a federal court in Texas vacated nationwide a 2024 HIPAA rule that added privacy protections for reproductive health information. The rule had barred using or disclosing such information to investigate or punish people for seeking or providing lawful reproductive care. The court found HHS exceeded its authority and unlawfully limited state public health laws. One part survived: updates to privacy notices for substance use disorder records, due by February 16, 2026.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.hklaw.com/en/insights/publications/2025/06/hipaas-reproductive-health-rule-is-vacated-nationally", "label": "Holland & Knight, HIPAA's reproductive health rule vacated nationally"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$f199e8b5-cfbf-5141-b54e-c2a7c9e94ef0$ml$::uuid, $ml$fd09bfa3-75e1-5b72-8781-374eb0464b74$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$Vacatur$ml$, $ml$Vacating a rule cancels it, not just for the parties in the case. This one was vacated nationwide.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.hklaw.com/en/insights/publications/2025/06/hipaas-reproductive-health-rule-is-vacated-nationally", "label": "Holland & Knight, HIPAA's reproductive health rule vacated nationally"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$6d129372-ecaa-59b0-9fc7-b1db5672d530$ml$::uuid, $ml$fd09bfa3-75e1-5b72-8781-374eb0464b74$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The reasoning$ml$, $ml$The court said HHS lacked authority and conflicted with state reporting laws. It relied on the Supreme Court's Loper Bright decision.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.hklaw.com/en/insights/publications/2025/06/hipaas-reproductive-health-rule-is-vacated-nationally", "label": "Holland & Knight, HIPAA's reproductive health rule vacated nationally"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$cc28ffa1-f0d8-519c-be5f-59e71f78fd41$ml$::uuid, $ml$fd09bfa3-75e1-5b72-8781-374eb0464b74$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Privacy notice updates$ml$, $ml$Changes to notices of privacy practices for substance use disorder records stayed in effect.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.hklaw.com/en/insights/publications/2025/06/hipaas-reproductive-health-rule-is-vacated-nationally", "label": "Holland & Knight, HIPAA's reproductive health rule vacated nationally"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$a0d6950f-5e13-55c3-bdef-d77e6a66df5a$ml$::uuid, $ml$fd09bfa3-75e1-5b72-8781-374eb0464b74$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Rules change by ruling$ml$, $ml$Health privacy compliance must track courts closely. Rules can vanish overnight.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.hklaw.com/en/insights/publications/2025/06/hipaas-reproductive-health-rule-is-vacated-nationally", "label": "Holland & Knight, HIPAA's reproductive health rule vacated nationally"}]$ml$::jsonb),
